    "describe_ch": "專題實作(二)為必修之終端課程，乃是整合學生修習之各項課程、所學之專業知識、或強調技能應用面之課程，以銜接學生畢業後升學、就業及社會之需求。",
    "describe_eh": "Practice of special topics (2) is the terminal lesson of all required course in school. It may use and merge with the various studied course, professional knowledge, and emphasize in technician applied course. Also after the student graduate from school, it may offer and link the requirement of a research institute, get employment, or society demand",
